 an edge in battle. Adventure awaits! Will you rise as Asteria's new King?","steam_appid":2186580,"support_info":{"email":"support@thearcadecrew.com","url":"https://www.thearcadecrew.com/support/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://www.thearcadecrew.com/games/shuffle-tactics/"}